<view class="page-shell"><navigation-bar title="我的收藏" back="{{true}}" color="#262822" background="#F5F1E8"></navigation-bar><scroll-view class="list-scroll" scroll-y enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="list-head"><text class="eyebrow">SAVED FOR LATER</text><text class="section-title">想做的菜</text><text>收藏与“做过”分开记录</text></view><view wx:if="{{recipes.length}}" class="favorite-list"><view wx:for="{{recipes}}" wx:key="recipeId" class="favorite-card" data-id="{{item.recipeId}}" bindtap="openRecipe"><view class="favorite-glyph tone-{{item.tone}}">{{item.glyph}}</view><view class="favorite-copy"><text class="favorite-title">{{item.title}}</text><text>{{item.mealFormLabel}} · 来源估计 {{item.sourceMinutes}} 分钟</text><text>{{item.servingNote}}</text></view><text class="chevron">›</text></view></view><view wx:else class="empty-state"><view class="empty-mark">♡</view><text class="empty-title">还没有收藏</text><text>遇到想做的菜，点一下收藏就会留在这里。</text></view><view class="safe-bottom"></view></scroll-view></view>
